[
  {
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      },
      {
        "field": "price",
        "type": "number",
        "operator": "gte"
      },
      {
        "field": "status",
        "type": "select",
        "operator": "equals"
      }
    ],
    "params": {
      "name": "りんご",
      "price": "100",
      "status": "active",
      "secret": "x"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [
        {
          "field": "name",
          "operator": "contains",
          "value": "りんご"
        },
        {
          "field": "price",
          "operator": "gte",
          "value": 100
        },
        {
          "field": "status",
          "operator": "equals",
          "value": "active"
        }
      ],
      "sortField": null,
      "sortAscending": true,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "params": {
      "page": "2",
      "pageSize": "20",
      "sortField": "name"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": "name",
      "sortAscending": true,
      "page": 2,
      "pageSize": 20
    }
  },
  {
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "params": {
      "sortField": "evil",
      "order": "desc"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": null,
      "sortAscending": false,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "$comment": "降順の指定は**文字列で届く**（REST の契約はクエリ文字列。真偽値だけで見ていると、降順を頼まれたのに黙って昇順で返す）",
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "params": {
      "sortField": "name",
      "sortAscending": "false"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": "name",
      "sortAscending": false,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "$comment": "文字列の \"true\" は昇順（\"false\" だけを降順として読む＝知らない字を降順に倒さない）",
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "params": {
      "sortField": "name",
      "sortAscending": "true"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": "name",
      "sortAscending": true,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "$comment": "**定義に書いた `sortable` な列でも並べ替えられる**（table を渡したとき）。渡さないと、`sortable: true` と書いた列が押せるのに並ばない＝「書いたのに効かない」。同梱の例も雛形も、絞り込みに無い列に sortable を書いているので、サーバは table を渡すのが既定。",
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "table": {
      "columns": [
        {
          "field": "name"
        },
        {
          "field": "price",
          "sortable": true
        },
        {
          "field": "memo"
        }
      ]
    },
    "params": {
      "sortField": "price",
      "sortAscending": "false"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": "price",
      "sortAscending": false,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "$comment": "**table を渡しても、そこに無い名前は通らない。** 安全側の決まりは変わらない（許すのは定義に書いてある名前だけで、利用者が送ってきた文字列ではない）。",
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "type": "text",
        "operator": "contains"
      }
    ],
    "table": {
      "columns": [
        {
          "field": "name"
        },
        {
          "field": "price",
          "sortable": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "params": {
      "sortField": "evil"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": null,
      "sortAscending": true,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  },
  {
    "$comment": "**`sortable` を書いていない列は通らない**（列に在るだけでは並べ替えを許さない）。",
    "filters": [],
    "table": {
      "columns": [
        {
          "field": "memo"
        }
      ]
    },
    "params": {
      "sortField": "memo"
    },
    "expected": {
      "conditions": [],
      "sortField": null,
      "sortAscending": true,
      "page": 0,
      "pageSize": 50
    }
  }
]
